(696, 'control', '/kən\'trəul/', '/kən\'trəul/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=control&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=control&type=1', 'n. / vt.', 'n. 控制, 管理, 克制, 控制器, 操纵装置\\nvt. 控制, 操纵, 抑制\\n[计] 控制; 控制器', 'n. power to direct or determine\\nn. a relation of constraint of one entity (thing or person or group) by another\\nn. (physiology) regulation or maintenance of a function or action or reflex etc\\nn. the activity of managing or exerting control over something', '中考, 高考, CET4, 考研, IELTS, GRE, Oxford3000, Collins-5★', 432, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(703, 'convert', '/kən\'və:t/', '/kən\'və:t/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=convert&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=convert&type=1', 'n. / vt. / vi.', 'n. 皈依者, 改变宗教信仰者\\nvt. 使改变信仰, 转换, 兑换, 倒置\\nvi. 皈依\\n[计] 转换', 'n. a person who has been converted to another religious or political belief\\nv. change from one system to another or to a new plan or policy\\nv. change the nature, purpose, or function of something\\nv. change religious beliefs, or adopt a religious belief', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, GRE, Oxford3000, Collins-3★', 2895, 'The cells have the capacity to convert food into energy.', '细胞具有将食物转化为能量的能力。'),
(705, 'convince', '/kən\'vins/', '/kən\'vins/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=convince&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=convince&type=1', 'vt.', 'vt. 说服, 使相信\\n[法] 使确信, 使信服, 使人认识错误', 'v make (someone) agree, understand, or realize the truth or validity of something', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, GRE, Oxford3000, Collins-3★', 2039, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(708, 'cooperate', '/kəu\'ɒpəreit/', '/kəu\'ɒpəreit/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=cooperate&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=cooperate&type=1', 'vi.', 'vi. 合作, 协力, 配合\\n[化] 合作', 'v work together on a common enterprise of project', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, GRE', 4015, 'We are working hard to cooperate more.', '我们正在努力扩展合作。'),
(709, 'coordinate', '/kəu\'ɒ:dineit/', '/kəu\'ɒ:dineit/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=coordinate&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=coordinate&type=1', 'n. / a. / v.', 'n. 同等的人(或物), 坐标\\na. 同等的, 并列的\\nv. (使)协调', 'n. a number that identifies a position relative to an axis\\nv. bring into common action, movement, or condition\\nv. be co-ordinated\\ns. of equal importance, rank, or degree', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, GRE, Collins-2★', 4847, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(713, 'cord', '/kɒ:d/', '/kɒ:d/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=cord&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=cord&type=1', 'n.', 'n. 绳索, 束缚\\n[医] 索, 带', 'n. a line made of twisted fibers or threads\\nn. a unit of amount of wood cut for burning; 128 cubic feet\\nn. a light insulated conductor for household use\\nn. a cut pile fabric with vertical ribs; usually made of cotton', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, GRE, Collins-2★', 4314, 'Is the power cord plugged into a power outlet?', '插头插到插座里了吗？'),
(714, 'core', '/kɒ:/', '/kɒ:/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=core&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=core&type=1', 'n. / vt.', 'n. 核心, 果心, 要点\\nvt. 挖...的核\\n[计] 内核, 核心网', 'n. a small group of indispensable persons or things\\nn. the center of an object\\nn. the central part of the Earth\\nn. a cylindrical sample of soil or rock obtained with a hollow drill', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, GRE, Oxford3000, Collins-3★', 1954, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(719, 'correspond', '/.kɒri\'spɒnd/', '/.kɒri\'spɒnd/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=correspond&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=correspond&type=1', 'vi.', 'vi. 符合, 通信, 相当\\n[法] 符合, 一致, 相当', 'v. exchange messages', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Collins-2★', 5415, 'I don\'t know anyone who corresponds to that description.', '我不认识符合条件的人。'),
(721, 'corridor', '/\'kɒridɒ:/', '/\'kɒridɒ:/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=corridor&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=corridor&type=1', 'n.', 'n. 走廊, 回廊, 人口密集地带', 'n. an enclosed passageway; rooms usually open onto it', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, Collins-2★', 3474, 'The loo is at the end of the corridor.', '厕所在走廊的尽头。'),
(725, 'cotton', '/\'kɒtn/', '/\'kɒtn/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=cotton&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=cotton&type=1', 'n. / vi.', 'n. 棉花\\nvi. 和谐, 有好感, 理解', 'n. soft silky fibers from cotton plants in their raw state\\nn. fabric woven from cotton fibers\\nn. erect bushy mallow plant or small tree bearing bolls containing seeds with many long hairy fibers\\nn. thread made of cotton fibers', '中考, 高考, CET4, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-3★', 3136, 'Someday I will buy a cotton candy machine.', '有一天我买了一台棉花糖机。'),
(726, 'cough', '/kɒf/', '/kɒf/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=cough&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=cough&type=1', 'n. / vi. / vt.', 'n. 咳嗽\\nvi. 咳嗽\\nvt. 咳出', 'n. a sudden noisy expulsion of air from the lungs that clears the air passages; a common symptom of upper respiratory infection or bronchitis or pneumonia or tuberculosis\\nv. exhale abruptly, as when one has a chest cold or congestion', '中考, 高考, CET4, 考研, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-3★', 6157, 'Cover your mouth when you cough, sneeze, or yawn.', '你咳嗽、打喷嚏或打哈欠的时候要捂住你的嘴。'),
(733, 'couple', '/\'kʌpl/', '/\'kʌpl/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=couple&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=couple&type=1', 'n. / vt. / vi.', 'n. 对, 夫妇, 数个\\nvt. 使成双, 连接, 使成婚, 把...联系起来\\nvi. 结合, 成婚', 'n. a pair who associate with one another\\nn. a pair of people who live together\\nn. a small indefinite number\\nn. two items of the same kind', '中考, 高考, CET4, 考研, TOEFL, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 531, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(740, 'crack', '/kræk/', '/kræk/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=crack&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=crack&type=1', 'n. / v. / a. / adv.', 'n. 裂缝, 爆裂声\\nv. (使)爆裂, (使)裂开, (使)发出爆裂声\\na. 第一流的\\nadv. 啪地一声', 'n. a long narrow opening\\nn. a sudden sharp noise\\nn. a blemish resulting from a break without complete separation of the parts\\nn. a purified and potent form of cocaine that is smoked rather than snorted; highly addictive', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, GRE, Oxford3000, Collins-2★', 3008, 'I can crack the password of this box.', '我能破译这个箱子的密码。'),
(743, 'crash', '/kræʃ/', '/kræʃ/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=crash&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=crash&type=1', 'n. / v. / a.', 'n. 哗啦声, 猛撞, 崩溃, 粗布\\nv. 撞碎, 破碎, (使)...坠毁\\na. 速成的\\n[计] 崩溃', 'n. a serious accident (usually involving one or more vehicles)\\nn. a sudden large decline of business or the prices of stocks (especially one that causes additional failures)\\nn. the act of colliding with something\\nn. (computer science) an event that causes a computer system to become inoperative', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 2837, 'She won\'t take an airplane for fear of a crash.', '她不会乘飞机因为害怕坠机。'),
(744, 'crawl', '/krɒ:l/', '/krɒ:l/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=crawl&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=crawl&type=1', 'n. / v.', 'n. 爬行, 匍匐而行, 养鱼池\\nv. 爬行', 'n. a very slow movement\\nn. a swimming stroke; arms are moved alternately overhead accompanied by a flutter kick\\nn. a slow mode of locomotion on hands and knees or dragging the body\\nv. move slowly; in the case of people or animals with the body near the ground', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Collins-2★', 3836, 'I\'m so embarrassed I could dig a hole and crawl into it.', '我窘得想找个洞钻进去。'),
(749, 'credit', '/\'kredit/', '/\'kredit/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=credit&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=credit&type=1', 'n. / vt.', 'n. 信用, 信任, 荣誉, 贷款, 学分\\nvt. 归功于, 赞颂, 信任, 相信\\n[计] 信用量', 'n. money available for a client to borrow\\nn. an accounting entry acknowledging income or capital items\\nn. used in the phrase `to your credit\' in order to indicate an achievement deserving praise;\\nn. arrangement for deferred payment for goods and services', '高考, TOEFL, IELTS, GRE, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 1125, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(764, 'cruel', '/\'kru:əl/', '/\'kru:əl/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=cruel&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=cruel&type=1', 'a.', 'a. 残酷的, 令人极痛苦的\\n[法] 残忍的, 残酷的', 's (of persons or their actions) able or disposed to inflict pain or suffering', '中考, 高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, Oxford3000, Collins-2★', 4762, 'How can you be so cruel?', '你怎么能如此狠毒？'),
(765, 'crush', '/krʌʃ/', '/krʌʃ/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=crush&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=crush&type=1', 'n. / vt. / vi.', 'n. 压碎, 粉碎, 群众, 迷恋\\nvt. 压破, 征服, 塞, 弄皱, 榨出\\nvi. 被压碎, 起皱, 挤', 'n. a dense crowd of people\\nn. the act of crushing\\nv. break into small pieces\\nv. humiliate or depress completely', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-2★', 4311, 'It\'s normal to experience workplace crushes, but remember to stay professional.', '在职场中对某人产生好感是很正常的，但记得要保持专业形象。'),
(772, 'culture', '/\'kʌltʃə/', '/\'kʌltʃə/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=culture&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=culture&type=1', 'n. / vt.', 'n. 文化, 修养, 耕种\\nvt. 耕种, 培养', 'n. a particular society at a particular time and place\\nn. the tastes in art and manners that are favored by a social group\\nn. (biology) the growing of microorganisms in a nutrient medium (such as gelatin or agar)\\nn. the attitudes and behavior that are characteristic of a particular social group or organization', '中考, 高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 611, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(774, 'cupboard', '/\'kʌpbɒ:d/', '/\'kʌpbɒ:d/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=cupboard&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=cupboard&type=1', 'n.', 'n. 食橱, 碗柜, 餐具柜', 'n. a small room (or recess) or cabinet used for storage space', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-2★', 9358, 'What\'s in that cupboard?', '橱柜里有什么？'),
(778, 'current', '/\'kʌrənt/', '/\'kʌrənt/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=current&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=current&type=1', 'n. / a.', 'n. 涌流, 趋势, 流\\na. 流通的, 现在的, 当前的, 流行的\\n[计] 当前的', 'n. a flow of electricity through a conductor\\nn. a steady flow of a fluid (usually from natural causes)\\na. occurring in or belonging to the present time', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-5★', 652, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(779, 'curse', '/kə:s/', '/kə:s/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=curse&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=curse&type=1', 'n. / vt.', 'n. 咒骂, 诅咒\\nvt. 诅咒, 咒骂', 'n. profane or obscene expression usually of surprise or anger\\nn. a severe affliction\\nv. utter obscenities or profanities\\nv. heap obscenities upon', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, IELTS, Collins-2★', 5761, 'Yes, people usually curse at someone they are acquainted with.', '对，人通常会对自己的熟人口出恶言。'),
(780, 'curtain', '/\'kə:tən/', '/\'kə:tən/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=curtain&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=curtain&type=1', 'n. / vt.', 'n. 帐, 幕, 窗帘\\nvt. 装帘子于, 遮蔽', 'n. hanging cloth used as a blind (especially for a window)\\nn. any barrier to communication or vision\\nv. provide with drapery', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, Oxford3000, Collins-3★', 3622, 'I can\'t see in because the curtains are closed.', '因为窗帘闭上了，所以无法望进里面。'),
(786, 'cycle', '/\'saikl/', '/\'saikl/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=cycle&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=cycle&type=1', 'n. / vi. / vt.', 'n. 周期, 循环, 自行车, 一段时间, 整套\\nvi. 循环, 轮转, 骑自行车\\nvt. 使循环, 使轮转\\n[计] 环路; 周期; 循环', 'n. an interval during which a recurring sequence of events occurs\\nn. a series of poems or songs on the same theme\\nn. a periodically repeated sequence of events\\nn. a single complete execution of a periodically repeated phenomenon', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-3★', 2220, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(792, 'damp', '/dæmp/', '/dæmp/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=damp&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=damp&type=1', 'n. / a. / vt. / vi.', 'n. 潮湿, 湿气\\na. 潮湿的\\nvt. 使潮湿, 使阻尼, 抑止\\nvi. 变潮湿, 衰减', 'n. a slight wetness\\nv. restrain or discourage\\ns. slightly wet', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, GRE, Oxford3000, Collins-2★', 5562, 'This damp match won\'t light.', '这根湿掉的火柴点不出火的。'),
(797, 'daring', '/\'dєəriŋ/', '/\'dєəriŋ/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=daring&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=daring&type=1', 'a.', 'a. 大胆的', 'n a challenge to do something dangerous or foolhardy\\nn the trait of being willing to undertake things that involve risk or danger\\nv take upon oneself; act presumptuously, without permission\\nv to be courageous enough to try or do something\\nv challenge\\ns disposed to venture or take risks\\ns radically new or original', 'CET4, CET6, TOEFL, Collins-2★', 9273, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。')
INSERT INTO `dict_entry` (`id`, `lemma`, `phonetic_us`, `phonetic_uk`, `audio_us`, `audio_uk`, `pos`, `definition_cn`, `definition_en`, `tags`, `frequency_rank`, `sample_sentence`, `sample_translation`)
VALUES
(798, 'dark', '/dɑ:k/', '/dɑ:k/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=dark&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=dark&type=1', 'n. / a.', 'n. 黑暗, 夜, 黄昏, 模糊\\na. 黑暗的, 暗的, 深色的, 隐密的, 模糊的, 无知的', 'n. absence of light or illumination\\nn. an unenlightened state\\na. devoid of or deficient in light or brightness; shadowed or black\\na. (used of color) having a dark hue', '中考, 高考, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 857, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(812, 'debate', '/di\'beit/', '/di\'beit/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=debate&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=debate&type=1', 'n. / v.', 'n. 辩论, 讨论\\nv. 争论, 辩论', 'n. the formal presentation of a stated proposition and the opposition to it (usually followed by a vote)\\nv. argue with one another\\nv. discuss the pros and cons of an issue', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, GRE, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 1082, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(813, 'debt', '/det/', '/det/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=debt&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=debt&type=1', 'n.', 'n. 债务, 罪过\\n[经] 借款, 欠款, 债务', 'n. the state of owing something (especially money)\\nn. money or goods or services owed by one person to another\\nn. an obligation to pay or do something', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 1871, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(814, 'decade', '/\'dekeid/', '/\'dekeid/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=decade&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=decade&type=1', 'n.', 'n. 十年, 十', 'n. a period of 10 years', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 730, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(825, 'deduce', '/di\'dju:s/', '/di\'dju:s/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=deduce&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=deduce&type=1', 'vt.', 'vt. 推论, 演绎出\\n[法] 推断, 推出, 演绎', 'v. reason by deduction; establish by deduction\\nv. conclude by reasoning; in logic', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, IELTS, GRE, Collins-1★', 13290, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(834, 'define', '/di\'fain/', '/di\'fain/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=define&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=define&type=1', 'vt.', 'vt. 定义, 规定, 使明确\\n[计] 定义', 'v. give a definition for the meaning of a word\\nv. determine the nature of\\nv. show the form or outline of', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, Oxford3000, Collins-3★', 1210, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(835, 'definite', '/\'definit/', '/\'definit/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=definite&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=definite&type=1', 'a.', 'a. 明确的, 一定的\\n[法] 明确的, 确切的, 一定的', 'a. precise; explicit and clearly defined\\ns. known for certain', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, GRE, Oxford3000, Collins-2★', 6780, 'I can\'t give you a definite answer today.', '我今天无法给您一个最终的答复。'),
(839, 'delay', '/di\'lei/', '/di\'lei/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=delay&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=delay&type=1', 'n. / v.', 'n. 耽搁, 迟滞\\nv. 耽搁, 延迟\\n[计] 延迟, 延时', 'n. time during which some action is awaited\\nn. the act of delaying; inactivity resulting in something being put off until a later time\\nv. cause to be slowed down or delayed\\nv. act later than planned, scheduled, or required', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 3105, 'I recommend you to set about your business without delay.', '我建议你准时开始干自己的活。'),
