(1699, 'indicate', '/\'indikeit/', '/\'indikeit/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=indicate&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=indicate&type=1', 'vt.', 'vt. 显示, 象征, 指示, 指出\\n[医] 指示', 'v. indicate a place, direction, person, or thing; either spatially or figuratively\\nv. to state or express briefly\\nv. suggest the necessity of an intervention; in medicine', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, GRE, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 785, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(1704, 'individual', '/.indi\'vidʒuəl/', '/.indi\'vidʒuəl/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=individual&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=individual&type=1', 'n. / a.', 'n. 人, 个人, 个体\\na. 个别的, 个人的, 独特的', 'n. a single organism\\na. being or characteristic of a single thing or person\\ns. separate and distinct from others of the same kind\\ns. characteristic of or meant for a single person or thing', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, IELTS, GRE, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 762, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(1711, 'infer', '/in\'fə:/', '/in\'fə:/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=infer&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=infer&type=1', 'vt. / vi.', 'vt. 推论出, 推断\\nvi. 作推论', 'v reason by deduction; establish by deduction\\nv draw from specific cases for more general cases\\nv conclude by reasoning; in logic\\nv guess correctly; solve by guessing\\nv believe to be the case', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, GRE, Collins-1★', 9219, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(1720, 'injection', '/in\'dʒekʃən/', '/in\'dʒekʃən/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=injection&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=injection&type=1', 'n.', 'n. 注射, 注射剂\\n[化] 注入; 注射', 'n. the forceful insertion of a substance under pressure\\nn. any solution that is injected (as into the skin)\\nn. the act of putting a liquid into the body by means of a syringe', 'CET4, CET6, IELTS, GRE, Collins-2★', 5734, 'It\'s alright. This injection won\'t hurt. It will just prick a little.', '没关系的，这个针不痛的，就只有一点点刺痛感。'),
(1721, 'injure', '/\'indʒə/', '/\'indʒə/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=injure&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=injure&type=1', 'vt.', 'vt. 伤害, 损害, 使受冤屈\\n[医] 损伤', 'v. cause injuries or bodily harm to', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, Oxford3000, Collins-1★', 3721, 'You may injure yourself if you don\'t follow safety procedures.', '如果你不按照安全手续来的话，你可能会受伤的。'),
(1726, 'innocent', '/\'inəsənt/', '/\'inəsənt/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=innocent&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=innocent&type=1', 'a. / n.', 'a. 无罪的, 不懂事的, 无知的\\nn. 天真的人, 笨蛋', 'n. a person who lacks knowledge of evil\\na. free from evil or guilt\\ns. lacking intent or capacity to injure\\ns. lacking in sophistication or worldliness', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-3★', 2775, 'I keep saying that I\'m innocent, but no one will listen.', '我再三申明无罪，但是没人听我讲。'),
(1727, 'input', '/\'input/', '/\'input/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=input&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=input&type=1', 'n. / vt.', 'n. 输入, 输入电路\\nvt. 输入\\n[计] 输入', 'n. a component of production; something that goes into the production of output\\nv. enter (data or a program) into a computer', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, Collins-2★', 4120, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(1729, 'inquiry', '/in\'kwaiəri/', '/in\'kwaiəri/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=inquiry&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=inquiry&type=1', 'n.', 'n. 质询, 探索, 调查, 询盘\\n[计] 询问; 查询', 'n. a search for knowledge\\nn. a systematic investigation of a matter of public interest', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, GRE, Oxford3000, Collins-3★', 3367, 'For media inquiries, please contact your local communications or marketing representative.', '如需媒体联络，请与当地客服中心或行销团队联系。'),
(1731, 'insert', '/in\'sə:t/', '/in\'sə:t/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=insert&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=insert&type=1', 'n. / vt. / vi.', 'n. 插入物\\nvt. 插入, 把(人造卫星)射入(轨道), 添写\\nvi. 附着\\n[计] 插入', 'n. a folded section placed between the leaves of another publication\\nn. an artifact that is inserted or is to be inserted\\nv. put or introduce into something\\nv. introduce', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, GRE, Oxford3000, Collins-2★', 4301, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(1734, 'inspect', '/in\'spekt/', '/in\'spekt/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=inspect&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=inspect&type=1', 'vt. / vi.', 'vt. 检查, 检阅, 检验\\nvi. 检查', 'v. look over carefully', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, Collins-3★', 5031, 'If you don\'t mind, may we inspect your suitcase?', '先生，我们可以检查一下您的行李吗？'),
(1737, 'instance', '/\'instəns/', '/\'instəns/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=instance&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=instance&type=1', 'n. / vt.', 'n. 建议, 情况, 例子, 场合\\nvt. 引以为例, 举例说明', 'n an occurrence of something\\nn an item of information that is typical of a class or group\\nv clarify by giving an example of', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 2957, 'Japan is full of beautiful cities. Kyoto and Nara, for instance.', '日本有许多美丽的城市，例如京都、奈良。'),
(1741, 'institute', '/\'institju:t/', '/\'institju:t/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=institute&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=institute&type=1', 'n. / vt.', 'n. 学会, 学院, 协会\\nvt. 创立, 开始, 制定, 任命', 'n. an association organized to promote art or science or education\\nv. advance or set forth in court', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, GRE, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 7980, 'A new classroom building was built in our institute last year.', '去年我们学院建了一个新教学楼。'),
(1743, 'instruct', '/in\'strʌkt/', '/in\'strʌkt/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=instruct&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=instruct&type=1', 'vt.', 'vt. 教, 教育, 命令, 通知\\n[法] 托办, 指导, 指示', 'v. give instructions or directions for some task\\nv. make aware of', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, Collins-3★', 4243, 'Please do as they have instructed you.', '请按他们教你的做。'),
(1745, 'instrument', '/\'instrumənt/', '/\'instrumənt/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=instrument&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=instrument&type=1', 'n.', 'n. 工具, 手段, 仪器\\n[化] 仪器', 'n. a device that requires skill for proper use\\nn. the means whereby some act is accomplished\\nn. a person used by another to gain an end\\nv. equip with instruments for measuring, recording, or controlling', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-3★', 1611, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(1747, 'insurance', '/in\'ʃurəns/', '/in\'ʃurəns/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=insurance&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=insurance&type=1', 'n.', 'n. 保险, 保险业, 保险费\\n[医] 保险', 'n. promise of reimbursement in the case of loss; paid to people or companies so concerned about hazards that they have made prepayments to an insurance company', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 1197, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(1750, 'intelligence', '/in\'telidʒəns/', '/in\'telidʒəns/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=intelligence&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=intelligence&type=1', 'n.', 'n. 智力, 情报, 信息\\n[医] 智力', 'n. the ability to comprehend; to understand and profit from experience\\nn. a unit responsible for gathering and interpreting information about an enemy\\nn. secret information about an enemy (or potential enemy)\\nn. the operation of gathering information about an enemy', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-3★', 1417, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(1753, 'intense', '/in\'tens/', '/in\'tens/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=intense&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=intense&type=1', 'a.', 'a. 非常的, 强烈的, 紧张的, 热情的\\n[医] 强的', 'a. possessing or displaying a distinctive feature to a heightened degree\\ns. (of color) having the highest saturation', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Collins-3★', 2295, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(1758, 'interest', '/\'intrist/', '/\'intrist/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=interest&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=interest&type=1', 'n. / vt.', 'n. 兴趣, 嗜好, 利息, 利益, 爱好, 趣味, 势力\\nvt. 使感兴趣, 与...有关系', 'n. a sense of concern with and curiosity about someone or something\\nn. the power of attracting or holding one\'s attention (because it is unusual or exciting etc.)\\nn. a fixed charge for borrowing money; usually a percentage of the amount borrowed\\nn. (law) a right or legal share of something; a financial involvement with something', '中考, 高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-5★', 416, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(1763, 'intermediate', '/.intə\'mi:diət/', '/.intə\'mi:diət/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=intermediate&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=intermediate&type=1', 'n. / a. / vi.', 'n. 中间物, 调停者, 中级\\na. 中间的, 中级的\\nvi. 起媒介作用\\n[计] 中级', 'n. a substance formed during a chemical process before the desired product is obtained\\na. lying between two extremes in time or space or state', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Collins-2★', 6876, 'My level in English is intermediate.', '我英文水平中等。'),
(1764, 'internal', '/in\'tə:nəl/', '/in\'tə:nəl/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=internal&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=internal&type=1', 'a.', 'a. 内在的, 国内的\\n[医] 内的, 内部的', 'a. happening or arising or located within some limits or especially surface\\ns. occurring within an institution or community', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-3★', 1728, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(1766, 'interpret', '/in\'tə:prit/', '/in\'tə:prit/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=interpret&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=interpret&type=1', 'vt. / vi.', 'vt. 解释, 演出, 翻译, 理解\\nvi. 翻译, 解释', 'v. make sense of; assign a meaning to\\nv. give an interpretation or rendition of', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-2★', 2755, 'How do you interpret these words?', '这几个字该怎么解释？'),
(1768, 'interrupt', '/.intə\'rʌpt/', '/.intə\'rʌpt/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=interrupt&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=interrupt&type=1', 'vt. / vi. / n.', 'vt. 中断, 妨碍, 插嘴\\nvi. 打断\\nn. 中断\\n[计] 中断', 'n. a signal that temporarily stops the execution of a program so that another procedure can be carried out\\nv. make a break in\\nv. destroy the peace or tranquility of\\nv. interfere in someone else\'s activity', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, GRE, Oxford3000, Collins-2★', 3407, 'Please don\'t interrupt me when I am speaking.', '我说话的时候请你不要插嘴。'),
(1769, 'interval', '/\'intəvəl/', '/\'intəvəl/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=interval&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=interval&type=1', 'n.', 'n. 间隔, 距离, 间歇, 间隙\\n[计] 时间间隔', 'n. a set containing all points (or all real numbers) between two given endpoints\\nn. the distance between things\\nn. the difference in pitch between two notes', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-2★', 4646, 'It\'s best to go to the dentist at regular intervals.', '最好定期去看牙医。'),
(1780, 'invest', '/in\'vest/', '/in\'vest/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=invest&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=invest&type=1', 'vt. / vi.', 'vt. 投资, 花费, 笼罩, 授予\\nvi. 投资, 利用', 'v. make an investment\\nv. furnish with power or authority; of kings or emperors\\nv. provide with power and authority', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-3★', 2001, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(1781, 'investigate', '/in\'vestigeit/', '/in\'vestigeit/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=investigate&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=investigate&type=1', 'v.', 'v. 调查, 审查', 'v. investigate scientifically\\nv. conduct an inquiry or investigation of', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, GRE, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 1802, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(1786, 'involve', '/in\'vɒlv/', '/in\'vɒlv/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=involve&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=involve&type=1', 'vt.', 'vt. 包括, 使陷于, 潜心于, 包围\\n[医] 累及, 牵涉, 包含', 'v. connect closely and often incriminatingly\\nv. engage as a participant\\nv. contain as a part\\nv. occupy or engage the interest of', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 656, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。')
