VALUES
(1788, 'iron', '/\'aiən/', '/\'aiən/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=iron&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=iron&type=1', 'n. / vt. / vi.', 'n. 铁, 熨斗, 铁器, 坚强, 烙铁, 镣铐\\nvt. 烫平, 熨, 用铁包\\nvi. 烫平', 'n. a heavy ductile magnetic metallic element; is silver-white in pure form but readily rusts; used in construction and tools and armament; plays a role in the transport of oxygen by the blood\\nn. a golf club that has a relatively narrow metal head\\nn. implement used to brand live stock\\nn. home appliance consisting of a flat metal base that is heated and used to smooth cloth', '中考, 高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, Oxford3000, Collins-3★', 2280, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(1790, 'isolate', '/\'aisəleit/', '/\'aisəleit/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=isolate&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=isolate&type=1', 'vt. / n.', 'vt. 使隔离, 使孤立, 使绝缘\\nn. 隔离种群', 'v. place or set apart\\nv. obtain in pure form\\nv. separate (experiences) from the emotions relating to them', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, GRE, Collins-1★', 3963, 'He\'s feeling isolated from being left alone on Mars.', '他被丢在火星上，感到非常沮丧。'),
(1791, 'issue', '/\'isju/', '/\'isju/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=issue&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=issue&type=1', 'n. / vi. / vt.', 'n. 发行, 问题, 后果, 流出, 出口, 争端\\nvi. 发行, 流出, 造成...结果, 传下\\nvt. 使流出, 放出, 发行, 发布, 发给', 'n. an important question that is in dispute and must be settled\\nn. one of a series published periodically\\nn. the act of providing an item for general use or for official purposes (usually in quantity)\\nn. supplies (as food or clothing or ammunition) issued by the government', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, GRE, Oxford3000, Collins-5★', 248, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(1793, 'item', '/\'aitəm/', '/\'aitəm/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=item&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=item&type=1', 'n.', 'n. 项目, 条款, 一则, 项\\n[计] 项', 'n. a distinct part that can be specified separately in a group of things that could be enumerated on a list\\nn. a whole individual unit; especially when included in a list or collection\\nr. (used when listing or enumerating items) also', 'CET4, 考研, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 1031, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(1802, 'jar', '/dʒɑ:/', '/dʒɑ:/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=jar&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=jar&type=1', 'n. / vi. / vt.', 'n. 广口瓶, 震动, 刺耳声\\nvi. 震惊, 冲突, 发刺耳声, 不一致\\nvt. 震动, 刺激', 'n. a vessel (usually cylindrical) with a wide mouth and without handles\\nn. the quantity contained in a jar\\nv. shock physically\\nv. affect in a disagreeable way', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, GRE, Collins-2★', 4262, 'This jam jar\'s lid is stuck and won\'t open.', '这个果酱瓶的盖子卡住了，打不开。'),
(1805, 'jealous', '/\'dʒeləs/', '/\'dʒeləs/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=jealous&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=jealous&type=1', 'a.', 'a. 嫉妒的, 羡慕的, 留心的, 戒备的', 's. suspicious or unduly suspicious or fearful of being displaced by a rival', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-2★', 6322, 'I\'m really jealous of your life right now.', '我很羡慕你现在的生活。'),
