(2749, 'reduction', '/ri\'dʌkʃən/', '/ri\'dʌkʃən/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=reduction&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=reduction&type=1', 'n.', 'n. 减少, 缩影, 变化\\n[化] 还原', 'n. any process in which electrons are added to an atom or ion (as by removing oxygen or adding hydrogen); always occurs accompanied by oxidation of the reducing agent\\nn. the act of reducing complexity', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, Oxford3000, Collins-3★', 2270, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(2751, 'reference', '/\'refərəns/', '/\'refərəns/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=reference&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=reference&type=1', 'n. / vt. / vi.', 'n. 参考, 索引, 参照\\nvt. 给...加上参考资料\\nvt. 引用\\nvi. 引用\\n[计] 引用', 'n. the most direct or specific meaning of a word or expression; the class of objects that an expression refers to\\nn. the act of referring or consulting\\nn. a publication (or a passage from a publication) that is referred to\\nn. the relation between a word or phrase and the object or idea it refers to', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-3★', 1904, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(2752, 'refine', '/ri\'fain/', '/ri\'fain/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=refine&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=refine&type=1', 'vt. / vi.', 'vt. 精炼, 净化, 使优雅, 使精炼\\nvi. 被精炼, 被净化', 'v. treat or prepare so as to put in a usable condition\\nv. reduce to a fine, unmixed, or pure state; separate from extraneous matter or cleanse from impurities\\nv. attenuate or reduce in vigor, strength, or validity by polishing or purifying\\nv. make more precise or increase the discriminatory powers of', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Collins-1★', 6600, 'Good day, lords. In what way can I refine upon my adroitness in aural comprehension?', '早安，师傅。我应该怎么样提高听力能力？'),
(2764, 'region', '/\'ri:dʒən/', '/\'ri:dʒən/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=region&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=region&type=1', 'n.', 'n. 区域, 地带, 地区, 领域, 范围, 区\\n[计] 区, 区域', 'n. the extended spatial location of something\\nn. a large indefinite location on the surface of the Earth\\nn. the approximate amount of something (usually used prepositionally as in `in the region of\')\\nn. a knowledge domain that you are interested in or are communicating about', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 793, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
