(2768, 'regulate', '/\'regjuleit/', '/\'regjuleit/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=regulate&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=regulate&type=1', 'vt.', 'vt. 管理, 控制, 调节, 调整, 校准\\n[经] 控制, 管理', 'v. fix or adjust the time, amount, degree, or rate of\\nv. bring into conformity with rules or principles or usage; impose regulations', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, GRE, Collins-2★', 3384, 'Traffic lights are used to regulate traffic.', '交通灯是用来控制交通的。'),
(2770, 'reinforce', '/.ri:in\'fɒ:s/', '/.ri:in\'fɒ:s/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=reinforce&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=reinforce&type=1', 'vt. / vi. / n.', 'vt. 加强, 增援, 补充\\nvi. 求援, 得到增援\\nn. 加固材料', 'v. make stronger\\nv. strengthen and support with rewards', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, GRE, Collins-2★', 3329, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
