(2777, 'relax', '/ri\'læks/', '/ri\'læks/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=relax&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=relax&type=1', 'vi. / vt.', 'vi. 放松, 松懈, 松弛, 变从容, 休息, 休养\\nvt. 使松弛, 缓和, 使松懈, 使休息', 'v. become less tense, rest, or take one\'s ease\\nv. make less taut\\nv. cause to feel relaxed\\nv. become less tense, less formal, or less restrained, and assume a friendlier manner', '中考, 高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, Oxford3000, Collins-3★', 2861, 'You can relax on the grass, but don\'t trample it.', '你可以休息在草地上，但是别踩它。'),
(2778, 'release', '/ri\'li:s/', '/ri\'li:s/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=release&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=release&type=1', 'n. / vt.', 'n. 释放, 发泄, 豁免, 发行, 释放证书\\nvt. 释放, 解除, 放松, 豁免, 免除, 发布, 放弃, 让与\\nn. 发布\\n[计] 版本, 发布', 'n. merchandise issued for sale or public showing (especially a record or film)\\nn. a process that liberates or discharges something\\nn. a device that when pressed will release part of a mechanism\\nn. activity that frees or expresses creative energy or emotion', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, GRE, Oxford3000, Collins-5★', 1120, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(2779, 'relevant', '/\'relivənt/', '/\'relivənt/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=relevant&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=relevant&type=1', 'a.', 'a. 有关联的, 有关系的, 适当的, 相应的\\n[法] 有关的, 相关的', 'a. having a bearing on or connection with the subject at issue', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-3★', 2814, 'That’s interesting, but is it relevant to the question?', '那很有意思，但和这个问题有关吗？'),
