(2812, 'require', '/ri\'kwaiə/', '/ri\'kwaiə/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=require&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=require&type=1', 'vt.', 'vt. 需要, 命令, 要求\\n[法] 需要, 要求, 命令', 'v require as useful, just, or proper\\nv consider obligatory; request and expect\\nv make someone do something\\nv have need of', '中考, 高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 446, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
