(2831, 'restless', '/\'restlis/', '/\'restlis/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=restless&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=restless&type=1', 'a.', 'a. 不安静的, 慌张的, 休息不充分的\\n[医] 不安静的, 不宁的', 's. worried and uneasy\\ns. ceaselessly in motion\\na. lacking or not affording physical or mental rest', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, IELTS, GRE, Collins-2★', 7303, 'You\'ve had a very restless night.', '你度过了很不安宁的一夜。'),
(2832, 'restore', '/ri\'stɒ:/', '/ri\'stɒ:/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=restore&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=restore&type=1', 'vt. / vi.', 'vt. 回复, 恢复, 归还, 修补, 修复\\nvt. 还原\\nvi. 还原\\n[计] 还原; DOS外部命令:从备份盘中取回文件', 'v. return to its original or usable and functioning condition\\nv. give or bring back\\nv. bring back into original existence, use, function, or position', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, GRE, Oxford3000, Collins-3★', 2543, 'A historical landmark has been restored and will reopen.', '一座历史地标已经修复并将重新开放。'),
(2833, 'restrain', '/ri\'strein/', '/ri\'strein/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=restrain&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=restrain&type=1', 'vt.', 'vt. 抑制, 阻止, 束缚\\n[法] 抑制, 遏制, 制止', 'v. keep under control; keep in check\\nv. to close within bounds, limit or hold back from movement\\nv. hold back', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, GRE, Collins-2★', 6825, 'You should learn to restrain yourself.', '你应该学习控制自己的情绪。'),
(2835, 'restrict', '/ri\'strikt/', '/ri\'strikt/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=restrict&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=restrict&type=1', 'vt.', 'vt. 限制, 限定, 约束\\n[医] 限制', 'v. place restrictions on\\nv. place under restrictions; limit access to\\nv. place limits on (extent or access)', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, Oxford3000, Collins-2★', 3539, 'I feel always restricted here.', '我在这里总感到约束。'),
(2836, 'resume', '/ri\'zju:m/', '/ri\'zju:m/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=resume&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=resume&type=1', 'vt. / vi. / n.', 'vt. 重新开始, 取回, 恢复\\nvi. 再开始\\nn. 摘要, 个人简历\\n[计] 继续执行', 'v. take up or begin anew\\nv. return to a previous location or condition\\nv. assume anew', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, GRE, Collins-1★', 3780, 'I don\'t worry so much about my resume.', '我对自己的履历不那么在意。'),
