(2840, 'reveal', '/ri\'vi:l/', '/ri\'vi:l/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=reveal&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=reveal&type=1', 'vt. / n.', 'vt. 露出, 显示, 透露, 揭露, 泄露, (神)启示\\nn. 窗侧, 门侧', 'v. disclose directly or through prophets', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 927, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(2841, 'reverse', '/ri\'və:s/', '/ri\'və:s/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=reverse&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=reverse&type=1', 'n. / a. / vt. / vi.', 'n. 相反, 背面, 倒退, 挫折, 失败\\na. 反面的, 相反的, 反向的, 颠倒的\\nvt. 使颠倒, 使逆转, 使倒退, 使反向\\nvi. 倒退, 反向, 倒转, 反转\\n[计] 反转', 'n. a relation of direct opposition\\nn. the gears by which the motion of a machine can be reversed\\nn. an unfortunate happening that hinders or impedes; something that is thwarting or frustrating\\nn. the side of a coin or medal that does not bear the principal design', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, GRE, Oxford3000, Collins-3★', 3497, 'You need to reverse your vest. It\'s inside-out!', '你的背心里外反了，来翻出来。'),
(2843, 'revise', '/ri\'vaiz/', '/ri\'vaiz/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=revise&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=revise&type=1', 'n. / vt.', 'n. 校订, 修正, 改样\\nvt. 校订, 修正, 校正', 'v. make revisions in', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, GRE, Oxford3000, Collins-2★', 5829, 'In the light of what you told us, I think we should revise our plan.', '根据你所说的话，我认为我们应该重新审视我们的计划。'),
(2845, 'revolution', '/.revə\'lu:ʃən/', '/.revə\'lu:ʃən/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=revolution&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=revolution&type=1', 'n.', 'n. 革命, 大变革, 旋转, 转数, 循环\\n[化] 回转', 'n. a drastic and far-reaching change in ways of thinking and behaving\\nn. the overthrow of a government by those who are governed', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, Oxford3000, Collins-3★', 2753, 'Revolutions that don\'t succeed are soon forgotten.', '失败的革命很快就被遗忘了。'),
(2848, 'rhythm', '/\'riðəm/', '/\'riðəm/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=rhythm&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=rhythm&type=1', 'n.', 'n. 旋律, 节奏, 韵律, 匀称, 张弛节律\\n[医] 节律', 'n. the basic rhythmic unit in a piece of music\\nn. recurring at regular intervals\\nn. the arrangement of spoken words alternating stressed and unstressed elements', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-3★', 3280, 'It\'s a slow Oriental rhythm.', '这是舒缓的东方节奏。')
