(2850, 'ribbon', '/\'ribən/', '/\'ribən/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=ribbon&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=ribbon&type=1', 'n. / vt. / vi.', 'n. 缎带, 色带, 带状物\\nvt. 用丝带装饰, 把...撕成条状\\nvi. 形成带状\\n[计] 带状条, 格式栏', 'n. any long object resembling a thin line\\nn. a long strip of inked material for making characters on paper with a typewriter\\nn. notion consisting of a narrow strip of fine material used for trimming', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Collins-2★', 4838, 'I used a ribbon to tie my hair into a ponytail.', '我用丝带在头上扎了一个马尾辫。'),
(2853, 'ridiculous', '/ri\'dikjuləs/', '/ri\'dikjuləs/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=ridiculous&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=ridiculous&type=1', 'a.', 'a. 荒谬的, 可笑的', 's inspiring scornful pity\\ns incongruous; inviting ridicule\\ns broadly or extravagantly humorous; resembling farce', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-2★', 4043, 'It would be ridiculous to spend all their money.', '花光他们所有的钱会很荒谬。'),
(2855, 'rigid', '/\'ridʒid/', '/\'ridʒid/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=rigid&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=rigid&type=1', 'a.', 'a. 坚硬的, 刚性的, 严格的, 精密的, 刻板的', 's. incapable of or resistant to bending\\ns. incapable of compromise or flexibility\\na. designating an airship or dirigible having a form maintained by a stiff unyielding frame or structure', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, GRE, Collins-2★', 5469, 'There\'s no need to be so rigid.', '用不着这么严格。'),
(2856, 'ripe', '/raip/', '/raip/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=ripe&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=ripe&type=1', 'a.', 'a. 成熟的, 熟练的, 成年的\\n[医] 成熟的', 'a. fully developed or matured and ready to be eaten or used\\ns. fully prepared or eager\\ns. at the highest point of development especially in judgment or knowledge', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, Collins-2★', 6068, 'Ripe medlars come away easily from the tree.', '成熟的枇杷很容易从树上摘下来。'),
(2860, 'roast', '/rəust/', '/rəust/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=roast&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=roast&type=1', 'n. / a. / vt. / vi.', 'n. 烤肉, 烘烤, 嘲笑\\na. 烘烤的, 烤过的\\nvt. 烤, 炙, 烘焙, 嘲笑\\nvi. 烤, 炙, 烘焙', 'n. a piece of meat roasted or for roasting and of a size for slicing into more than one portion\\nv. cook with dry heat, usually in an oven\\ns. (meat) cooked by dry heat in an oven', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Collins-2★', 7679, 'How about some more roast beef?', '再多一些烤牛肉怎么样?'),
(2870, 'rotten', '/\'rɒtn/', '/\'rɒtn/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=rotten&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=rotten&type=1', 'a.', 'a. 腐烂的, 恶臭的, 堕落的, 风化的, 虚弱的\\n[经] 腐烂的, 堕落的', 's. having decayed or disintegrated; usually implies foulness', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, GRE, Collins-2★', 8385, 'I think the eggs that I just ate were rotten.', '我觉得我刚吃的鸡蛋坏了。'),
(2871, 'rough', '/rʌf/', '/rʌf/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=rough&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=rough&type=1', 'n. / a. / vt. / vi. / adv.', 'n. 粗糙的东西, 毛坯, 未加工品, 梗概, 草图, 暴徒, 艰难\\na. 粗糙的, 粗暴的, 蓬乱的, 草率的, 大致的, 简陋的, 暴风雨的, 艰难的\\nvt. 使粗糙, 使不平, 使蓬乱, 粗制, 草拟, 粗暴对待, 对...动粗\\nvi. 变粗糙\\nadv. 粗糙地, 粗暴地', 'n. the part of a golf course bordering the fairway where the grass is not cut short\\na. having or caused by an irregular surface\\ns. (of persons or behavior) lacking refinement or finesse\\na. of the margin of a leaf shape; having the edge cut or fringed or scalloped', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-3★', 2627, 'At a rough estimate, I would say the job will take two weeks.', '我想这工作粗略估计得花上两个星期的时间。'),
(2873, 'route', '/ru:t/', '/ru:t/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=route&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=route&type=1', 'n. / vt.', 'n. 路径, 途径, 路线\\nvt. 确定路线, 按规定路线发送\\n[计] 传递, 路由设定程序', 'v. send documents or materials to appropriate destinations\\nv. send via a specific route\\nv. divert in a specified direction', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 1946, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(2879, 'rush', '/rʌʃ/', '/rʌʃ/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=rush&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=rush&type=1', 'n. / vi. / vt. / a.', 'n. 匆促, 冲进, 急流, 灯心草\\nvi. 冲, 奔, 闯, 赶紧, 匆促行事, 涌现\\nvt. 使冲, 匆忙地做, 突袭, 飞跃, 用灯心草做\\na. 紧急的', 'n. a sudden forceful flow\\nn. grasslike plants growing in wet places and having cylindrical often hollow stems\\nn. physician and American Revolutionary leader; signer of the Declaration of Independence (1745-1813)\\nn. a sudden burst of activity', '中考, 高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, Oxford3000, Collins-3★', 1956, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(2889, 'saucer', '/\'sɒ:sə/', '/\'sɒ:sə/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=saucer&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=saucer&type=1', 'n.', 'n. 茶碟, 茶托\\n[医] 碟', 'n. a small shallow dish for holding a cup at the table', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, Collins-1★', 10769, 'I\'ve seen a flying saucer.', '我看见了一个不明飞行物。'),
(2891, 'saw', '/sɒ:/', '/sɒ:/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=saw&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=saw&type=1', 'n. / vt. / vi.', 'n. 锯子, 谚语\\nvt. 锯, 锯开, 来回移动\\nvi. 拉锯, 移动\\nsee的过去式', 'n. hand tool having a toothed blade for cutting\\nv. cut with a saw', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, Collins-1★', 7433, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(2898, 'schedule', '/\'skedʒuəl/', '/\'skedʒuəl/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=schedule&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=schedule&type=1', 'n. / vt.', 'n. 时间表, 一览表, 计划表, 议事日程\\nvt. 预定, 编制目录, 制...表, 安排', 'n. an ordered list of times at which things are planned to occur\\nv. plan for an activity or event\\nv. make a schedule; plan the time and place for events', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 2144, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(2899, 'scheme', '/ski:m/', '/ski:m/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=scheme&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=scheme&type=1', 'n. / v.', 'n. 方案, 计划, 组合, 系统, 图解, 诡计, 阴谋\\nv. 计划, 设计, 图谋, 策划', 'n. an elaborate and systematic plan of action\\nv. form intrigues (for) in an underhand manner\\nv. devise a system or form a scheme for', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, GRE, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 3007, 'Your help is indispensable for the success of the scheme.', '没有你帮忙，计划就不能成功了。'),
(2900, 'scholar', '/\'skɒlə/', '/\'skɒlə/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=scholar&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=scholar&type=1', 'n.', 'n. 学者, 奖学金获得者, 有文化者, 学习者', 'n. a learned person (especially in the humanities); someone who by long study has gained mastery in one or more disciplines\\nn. a student who holds a scholarship', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, Collins-2★', 2101, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(2906, 'scratch', '/skrætʃ/', '/skrætʃ/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=scratch&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=scratch&type=1', 'n. / vt. / vi. / a.', 'n. 抓痕, 搔, 抓, 擦伤, 刮擦声, 乱写, 零分, 起跑线\\nvt. 搔, 抓, 挖出, 擦, 刮, 乱涂, 勾抹掉\\nvi. 搔, 抓, 发刮擦声, 勉强糊口\\na. 碰巧的, 凑合的, 打草稿用的\\n[计] 擦除', 'n. a competitor who has withdrawn from competition\\nn. (golf) a handicap of zero strokes\\nn. an indication of damage\\nv. cut the surface of; wear away the surface of', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-2★', 4644, 'Have I got to do it from scratch?', '我得从头开始做吗？'),
(2907, 'screw', '/skru:/', '/skru:/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=screw&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=screw&type=1', 'n. / vt. / vi.', 'n. 螺旋, 螺杆, 螺钉, 螺旋桨, 吝啬鬼\\nvt. 调节, 扭紧, 旋, 拧, 加强, 压榨, 勒索\\nvi. 转动, 旋, 拧', 'n. a simple machine of the inclined-plane type consisting of a spirally threaded cylindrical rod that engages with a similarly threaded hole\\nn. a propeller with several angled blades that rotates to push against water or air\\nn. a fastener with a tapered threaded shank and a slotted head\\nv. turn like a screw', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, GRE, Oxford3000, Collins-2★', 4750, 'Now all you have to do is tighten the screw, and Bob\'s your uncle.', '现在你只要拧紧螺丝，就大功告成了。'),
(2911, 'section', '/\'sekʃən/', '/\'sekʃən/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=section&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=section&type=1', 'n. / vt. / vi.', 'n. 区段, 部分, 区域, 节, 截面, 处, 科, 区, 扇区\\nvt. 把...分段, 把...切片\\nvi. 被切成片\\n[计] 扇区', 'n. a self-contained part of a larger composition (written or musical)\\nn. a very thin slice (of tissue or mineral or other substance) for examination under a microscope\\nn. a distinct region or subdivision of a territorial or political area or community or group of people\\nn. one of several parts or pieces that fit with others to constitute a whole object', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 818, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(2912, 'secure', '/si\'kjuə/', '/si\'kjuə/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=secure&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=secure&type=1', 'a. / vt. / vi.', 'a. 无虑的, 安心的, 安全的, 可靠的, 保险的\\nvt. 固定, 获得, 保证, 使安全, 掩护, 招致\\nvi. 停止操作, 船抛锚', 'v. assure payment of\\na. free from fear or doubt; easy in mind\\na. free from danger or risk\\na. not likely to fail or give way', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, GRE, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 2489, 'Don\'t climb that ladder – it\'s not secure.', '不要爬那个梯子，它不安全。'),
(2913, 'security', '/si\'kjuriti/', '/si\'kjuriti/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=security&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=security&type=1', 'n.', 'n. 安全, 安全性, 防护物, 保安, 可靠性, 担保人, 抵押品, 保证金\\n[计] 安全性, 保密性, 安全检查程序', 'n. the state of being free from danger or injury\\nn. defense against financial failure; financial independence\\nn. freedom from anxiety or fear\\nn. a formal declaration that documents a fact of relevance to finance and investment; the holder has a right to receive interest or dividends', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, Oxford3000, Collins-5★', 661, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(2915, 'seek', '/si:k/', '/si:k/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=seek&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=seek&type=1', 'vt. / vi.', 'vt. 寻求, 寻找, 探索, 追求, 搜索, 请求\\nvi. 寻找, 搜索\\n[计] 查找', 'n. the movement of a read/write head to a specific data track on a disk\\nv. try to get or reach\\nv. go to or towards\\nv. inquire for', '高考, CET4, CET6, 考研, Oxford3000, Collins-5★', 668, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(2922, 'sequence', '/\'si:kwəns/', '/\'si:kwəns/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=sequence&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=sequence&type=1', 'n. / vt.', 'n. 序列, 续发事件, 顺序, 连续\\nvt. 按顺序排好\\n[计] 顺序', 'n. serial arrangement in which things follow in logical order or a recurrent pattern\\nn. a following of one thing after another in time\\nn. film consisting of a succession of related shots that develop a given subject in a movie\\nn. several repetitions of a melodic phrase in different keys', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, TOEFL, IELTS, Collins-2★', 3143, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
(2923, 'series', '/\'siəri:z/', '/\'siəri:z/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=series&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=series&type=1', 'n.', 'n. 串联, 序列, 连续, 系列, 丛书, 套, 级数, 组\\n[计] 系列', 'n. similar things placed in order or happening one after another\\nn. a periodical that appears at scheduled times\\nn. (sports) several contests played successively by the same teams\\nn. (electronics) connection of components in such a manner that current flows first through one and then through the other', 'CET4, CET6, 考研, IELTS, Oxford3000, Collins-4★', 718, 'Every new word mastered brings you closer to linguistic fluency.', '掌握的每一个新词都让你离语言流利更近一步。'),
