(4261, 'hermeneutic', '/.hә:mә\'nju:tik/', '/.hә:mә\'nju:tik/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=hermeneutic&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=hermeneutic&type=1', 'n./v.', 'a. 解释的； n. 解释学, 圣经注解学', 'a. interpretive or explanatory', '', 26177, 'The term \'hermeneutic\' is frequently used in context.', '术语 \'hermeneutic\' 在该语境中经常被使用。'),
(4262, 'resource', '/ri\'sɒ:s/', '/ri\'sɒ:s/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=resource&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=resource&type=1', 'n./v.', 'n. 资源, 财力, 办法, 策略, 急智, 消遣； [计] 资源', 'n. available source of wealth; a new or reserve supply that can be drawn upon when needed; n. a source of aid or support that may be drawn upon when needed; n. the ability to deal resourcefully with unusual problems', 'cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts', 769, 'The term \'resource\' is frequently used in context.', '术语 \'resource\' 在该语境中经常被使用。'),
(4263, 'rinse', '/rins/', '/rins/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=rinse&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=rinse&type=1', 'n./v.', 'n. 清洗, 染发, 染发剂； vt. 以清水冲洗, 漱, 漂清； vi. 被漂净', 'n. a liquid preparation used on wet hair to give it a tint; n. the removal of soap with clean water in the final stage of washing; n. the act of giving a light tint to the hair; n. washing lightly without soap', 'cet6 toefl gre', 7024, 'The term \'rinse\' is frequently used in context.', '术语 \'rinse\' 在该语境中经常被使用。'),
(4264, 'approach', '/ә\'prәutʃ/', '/ә\'prәutʃ/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=approach&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=approach&type=1', 'n./v.', 'n. 接近, 入门； vt. 接近, 近似, 找...商量； vi. 靠近', 'n. ideas or actions intended to deal with a problem or situation; n. the act of drawing spatially closer to something; n. the event of one object coming closer to another; n. the temporal property of becoming nearer in time', 'gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts gre', 750, 'The term \'approach\' is frequently used in context.', '术语 \'approach\' 在该语境中经常被使用。'),
(4265, 'bin', '/bin/', '/bin/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=bin&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=bin&type=1', 'n./v.', 'n. (贮存谷物等的)容器, 箱子； [计] 二进制, 商业信息网', 'n. a container; usually has a lid; n. the quantity contained in a bin; v. store in bins', 'ky gre', 0, 'The term \'bin\' is frequently used in context.', '术语 \'bin\' 在该语境中经常被使用。'),
(4266, 'smash', '/smæʃ/', '/smæʃ/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=smash&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=smash&type=1', 'n./v.', 'n. 打碎, 粉碎, 打碎时哗啦声, 猛击, 扣球, 杀球, 经营失败, 破产, 硬币, 假硬币； a. 非常轰动的, 了不起的； vt. 打碎, 粉碎, 击溃, 使破产, 使裂变, 使用假硬币； vi. 碎裂, 猛撞, 破产, 扣球, 杀球； adv. 轰隆一声, 哗啦一声', 'n. a serious collision (especially of motor vehicles); v. hit hard; v. break into pieces, as by striking or knocking over; v. hit violently', 'cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts', 5113, 'The term \'smash\' is frequently used in context.', '术语 \'smash\' 在该语境中经常被使用。'),
(4267, 'containerization', '/kәn,teinәrai\'zeiʃәn; -ri\'z-/', '/kәn,teinәrai\'zeiʃәn; -ri\'z-/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=containerization&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=containerization&type=1', 'n./v.', 'n. 集装箱化； [经] 货柜箱化, 货柜箱运输', '', '', 0, 'The term \'containerization\' is frequently used in context.', '术语 \'containerization\' 在该语境中经常被使用。'),
(4268, 'embedding', '/em\'bediŋ/', '/em\'bediŋ/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=embedding&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=embedding&type=1', 'n./v.', '[化] 埋置; 包埋; (塑料的)嵌铸； [医] 包埋, 植入', 'v fix or set securely or deeply; v attach to, as a journalist to a military unit when reporting on a war', '', 27523, 'The term \'embedding\' is frequently used in context.', '术语 \'embedding\' 在该语境中经常被使用。'),
(4269, 'treadmill', '/\'tredmil/', '/\'tredmil/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=treadmill&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=treadmill&type=1', 'n./v.', 'n. 踏车, 令人厌倦的工作； [法] 踏车', 'n. an exercise device consisting of an endless belt on which a person can walk or jog without changing place; n. a mill that is powered by men or animals walking on a circular belt or climbing steps; n. a job involving drudgery and confinement', 'toefl', 9677, 'The term \'treadmill\' is frequently used in context.', '术语 \'treadmill\' 在该语境中经常被使用。'),
(4270, 'agreement', '/ә\'gri:mәnt/', '/ә\'gri:mәnt/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=agreement&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=agreement&type=1', 'n./v.', 'n. 同意, 合约, 协议； [经] 契约, 协议, 协定', 'n. the statement (oral or written) of an exchange of promises; n. compatibility of observations; n. harmony of people\'s opinions or actions or characters; n. the thing arranged or agreed to', 'zk gk ielts', 1059, 'The term \'agreement\' is frequently used in context.', '术语 \'agreement\' 在该语境中经常被使用。'),
(4271, 'validate', '/\'vælideit/', '/\'vælideit/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=validate&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=validate&type=1', 'n./v.', 'vt. 使有效, 使生效, 确认, 证实, 验证； [计] 验证', 'v. declare or make legally valid; v. prove valid; show or confirm the validity of something; v. give evidence for; v. make valid or confirm the validity of', 'toefl gre', 7516, 'The term \'validate\' is frequently used in context.', '术语 \'validate\' 在该语境中经常被使用。'),
(4272, 'generative', '/\'dʒenәrәtiv/', '/\'dʒenәrәtiv/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=generative&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=generative&type=1', 'n./v.', 'a. 生殖的, 生产的, 有生殖力的； [医] 生殖的, 发生的', 'a. having the ability to produce or originate; s. producing new life or offspring', '', 21588, 'The term \'generative\' is frequently used in context.', '术语 \'generative\' 在该语境中经常被使用。'),
