(4274, 'numb', '/nʌm/', '/nʌm/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=numb&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=numb&type=1', 'n./v.', 'a. 麻木的, 失去知觉的； vt. 使麻木, 使昏迷, 使失去知觉', 'v. make numb or insensitive; s. so frightened as to be unable to move; stunned or paralyzed with terror; petrified', 'gk ky toefl ielts gre', 9317, 'The term \'numb\' is frequently used in context.', '术语 \'numb\' 在该语境中经常被使用。'),
(4275, 'visa', '/\'vi:zә/', '/\'vi:zә/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=visa&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=visa&type=1', 'n./v.', 'n. 签证； vt. 签发', 'n. an endorsement made in a passport that allows the bearer to enter the country issuing it; v. provide (a passport) with a visa; v. approve officially', 'gk cet6 ky ielts', 5525, 'The term \'visa\' is frequently used in context.', '术语 \'visa\' 在该语境中经常被使用。'),
