(4277, 'dude', '/dju:d/', '/dju:d/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=dude&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=dude&type=1', 'n./v.', 'n.<美国、加拿大>纨绔子弟，花花公子； <俚>男人，家伙；； vt.<俚>打扮得讲究或花哨', 'n an informal form of address for a man; n a man who is much concerned with his dress and appearance', '', 8373, 'The term \'dude\' is frequently used in context.', '术语 \'dude\' 在该语境中经常被使用。'),
