(4279, 'gulp', '/gʌlp/', '/gʌlp/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=gulp&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=gulp&type=1', 'n./v.', 'vt. 吞, 大口大口地吸气, 吸收, 抑制； vi. 吞咽； n. 吞咽； [计] 字节组', 'n. a large and hurried swallow; n. a spasmodic reflex of the throat made as if in swallowing; v. to swallow hurriedly or greedily or in one draught; v. utter or make a noise, as when swallowing too quickly', 'toefl gre', 11209, 'The term \'gulp\' is frequently used in context.', '术语 \'gulp\' 在该语境中经常被使用。'),
