(4281, 'haircut', '/\'hєәkʌt/', '/\'hєәkʌt/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=haircut&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=haircut&type=1', 'n./v.', 'n. 理发, (男子的)发式', 'n. the style in which hair has been cut; n. the act of cutting the hair', 'gk cet4 cet6', 8476, 'The term \'haircut\' is frequently used in context.', '术语 \'haircut\' 在该语境中经常被使用。'),
(4282, 'overflow', '/.әuvә\'flәu/', '/.әuvә\'flәu/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=overflow&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=overflow&type=1', 'n./v.', 'n. 溢值, 超值, 泛滥； v. (使)泛滥, (使)溢出, (使)充溢； [计] 上溢; 溢出', 'n. the occurrence of surplus liquid (as water) exceeding the limit or capacity; v. flow or run over (a limit or brim)', 'cet6 ky toefl ielts gre', 9278, 'The term \'overflow\' is frequently used in context.', '术语 \'overflow\' 在该语境中经常被使用。'),
