(4285, 'takeaway', '/takeaway/', '/takeaway/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=takeaway&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=takeaway&type=1', 'n./v.', 'a. 外吃的, 外卖的； n. 外卖食品的餐馆, 外卖食品的商店', 'n. a concession made by a labor union to a company that is trying to lower its expenditures; n. the act of taking the ball or puck away from the team on the offense (as by the interception of a pass)', '', 24354, 'The term \'takeaway\' is frequently used in context.', '术语 \'takeaway\' 在该语境中经常被使用。')
