(4293, 'authenticate', '/ɒ:\'θentikeit/', '/ɒ:\'θentikeit/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=authenticate&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=authenticate&type=1', 'n./v.', 'vt. 证明可信, 证实为真, 使具法律效力； [法] 认证, 鉴定, 证明', 'v. establish the authenticity of something', 'toefl', 19855, 'The term \'authenticate\' is frequently used in context.', '术语 \'authenticate\' 在该语境中经常被使用。'),
