(4680, 'protocol', '/\'prәutәkɒl/', '/\'prәutәkɒl/', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=protocol&type=2', 'https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=protocol&type=1', 'n./v.', 'n. 草案, 礼仪, 协议； v. 拟定； [计] 协议, 协议列表实用程序', 'n. (computer science) rules determining the format and transmission of data; n. forms of ceremony and etiquette observed by diplomats and heads of state; n. code of correct conduct', 'ielts gre', 4485, 'The term \'protocol\' is frequently used in context.', '术语 \'protocol\' 在该语境中经常被使用。'),
